{
  "_about": "A room's stock and dosing stores exactly as 3.8.0 left them, modelled on a live room on 4 Oct 2026 (entity ids made generic). Four stock tanks, each linked to one pump of a 5.1.x ESPHome peristaltic doser that a Home Assistant automation doses by pressing its dose button, so the controller app never ran a dose there and never sent a draw. The levels were set by hand on 29 Sep and never moved: the history is 30 fills of the batch tank that drew nothing (every tank is linked to a pump), and there are no draw keys. Seed 'stock' and 'dosing' as the stores crop_steering.stock.<entry_id> and crop_steering.dosing.<entry_id>. 'states' is the doser idle, as it reports: its status reads 'Stopped' ('Running (Manual)' while it doses, which the setup's default dosing prefix 'Dosing' never matches) and its power switch reads off (on while it doses).",
